{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4181, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 2691, "text": "So, Mac, what's news?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 8526, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4726, "text": "\"Tornado rips up Nebraska trailer park.\""}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11564, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8697, "text": "Those things always head straight\nfor the trailer parks."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14334, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12400, "text": "Why do you think\nthey call them mobile homes?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 19505, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17605, "text": "Uh... Mobile homes."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 25570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 22510, "text": "Hey, Dan, you know,\nI know it's tough, but try to have a heart."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 28910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25747, "text": "Come on, I read the same story.\nNobody was hurt, right, Mac?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 33180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29084, "text": "\"No injuries. Hundreds left homeless.\""}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 35152, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33355, "text": "There. Happy?"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 37382, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36358, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 38651, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37559, "text": "- Hi, judge.\n- Hey, Harry."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 42524, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38827, "text": "Hey, you wanna wad this stuff up?\nWe could have a giant spitball fight."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 47565, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44232, "text": "- Is that the stuff you have to review?\n- About one one-hundredth of it."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 49829, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47736, "text": "I'm gonna spend the next nine hours..."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 52997, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50005, "text": "...going over the thousands of bail reports\nI approved this year."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 55768, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53174, "text": "Wait. You mean,\nyou're not gonna be our judge tonight?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 58913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 55944, "text": "No, you got a replacement coming in\nfrom the Brooklyn court."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 61810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59080, "text": "So, what are you guys gonna do\nwithout me, huh?"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 87107, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82704, "text": "Well, I guess some of you\nwill think of something."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 140957, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136691, "text": "I'll give them 15 seconds\nto start breathing again."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 144358, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 141696, "text": "Then I go in after her."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 154273, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151873, "text": "Thank God nobody was hurt."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 156442, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 155009, "text": "Are you still married?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 158443, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 157078, "text": "She passed away."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 159739, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 158613, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 163448, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 161116, "text": "I mean, the way you're taking it."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 165347, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 163618, "text": "You get over things."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 168616, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 165954, "text": "Not all the time."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 176059, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173261, "text": "We can handle this alone, thank you."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 178765, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176831, "text": "Is there some place we could talk?"}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 180730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178933, "text": "This is a big building."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 183600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 181336, "text": "I'm a big boy."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 187336, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184139, "text": "That's how Frankie\nused to talk to Annette."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 191206, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187509, "text": "Selma, aren't you gonna introduce us\nto your?"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 194746, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191379, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry.\nThis is Marty Ratner, everybody."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 196406, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194916, "text": "- Hi.\nHi, Marty."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 197983, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196584, "text": "We didn't mean to gawk..."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 200986, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198153, "text": "...it's just that we weren't aware\nthat Selma was..."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 203649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201556, "text": "Alive?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 205923, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204058, "text": "I was gonna say \"involved.\""}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 208221, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206094, "text": "Remember our last date?"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 214164, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208396, "text": "Yes. You picked me up at 7:20\nin your tan Buick."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 216895, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214335, "text": "We had wine, lobster..."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 221599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217071, "text": "...and danced until 3:45 in the morning."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 223307, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222010, "text": "Well, isn't that...?"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 225742, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223478, "text": "Almost interesting."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 227176, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225914, "text": "We think so."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 229407, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227348, "text": "It was 45 years ago."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 232684, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229851, "text": "Let's go someplace\nwhere we can catch up."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 233878, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232854, "text": "I'm all ears."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 237183, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 234055, "text": "That's not the way I remember it."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 241184, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238693, "text": "Good evening. I'm Arnold Koppelson."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 244923, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241362, "text": "- You must be our man from Brooklyn.\n- And you must be Judge Harold Stone."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 248626, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245099, "text": "- Wild guess?\n- I never guess, I just knew."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 250896, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 248803, "text": "I hope you people realize\nhow lucky you are..."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 253370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251072, "text": "...to be working with a man like this."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 256905, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254175, "text": "We often hear of your talents\nin the Brooklyn court."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 260138, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 257078, "text": "So I consider it a privilege\nand an honor to sit on your bench..."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 261612, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260315, "text": "...even for a brief session."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 263978, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261783, "text": "Well, I'll see you all in the courtroom."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 270016, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 266387, "text": "He was really shoveling it fast and furious,\nwasn't he?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 273553, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270425, "text": "Well, now, Dan, maybe he was sincere."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 277357, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273728, "text": "Sincere? He made Harry\nseem like the Second Coming."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 290768, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285740, "text": "An unassuming little burgundy\nyou might find amusing."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 296249, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293348, "text": "Red with Jell-O?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 303751, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 300054, "text": "- So that was your third husband.\n- Yes."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 306853, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 304692, "text": "But the one you left at the toll plaza..."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 308086, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307028, "text": "Number five."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 311664, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 309264, "text": "I thought five was the contortionist."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 313095, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 311833, "text": "Oh, that was Phil."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 315759, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313268, "text": "The one who drove with his feet?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 317461, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 315937, "text": "He ate with them too."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 322674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318840, "text": "I stayed away from carnivals after that."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 324335, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323311, "text": "All rise."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 328208, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326047, "text": "Criminal court part two\nis now in session."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 330351, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328383, "text": "The Honorable..."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 333846, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331252, "text": "...\"Arnold Koppelson\"..."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 336284, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 334555, "text": "...presiding."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 338186, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336924, "text": "You may be seated."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 343319, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340828, "text": "Oh, and, bailiff, may I just say..."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 346433, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343498, "text": "...that having a presence\nas strong as yours in the courtroom..."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 348193, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346601, "text": "...is reassuring,\nto say the least."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 351738, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349270, "text": "- Thank you, sir.\n- Your welcome."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 363111, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360415, "text": "- Here's tonight's docket, sir.\n- Oh, thank you."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 364751, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363284, "text": "What a pleasant man."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 367945, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364919, "text": "Yeah, I don't trust him either."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 370651, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 368456, "text": "<i>People v. Milo Wright.</i>"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 372986, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370825, "text": "- Your Honor, Mr. Wright was arrested...\nI..."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 376028, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373161, "text": "I read your report, Mr. Fielding.\nI know all about it."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 378495, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376197, "text": "- Merely trying to be helpful, sir.\n- No need."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 380361, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 378666, "text": "Your sense of accuracy is uncanny..."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 382901, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380535, "text": "...and your attention to detail\nis extraordinary."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 386097, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383071, "text": "It virtually jumps off the paper."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 389567, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387508, "text": "Uh... W-w-well, thank you, sir."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 392708, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389944, "text": "And you say\nyou're only an assistant DA, huh?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 395680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393314, "text": "You know, frankly, Mr. Fielding,\nthat stuns me..."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 399980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 395850, "text": "...but I'm sure it's just an oversight that\nwill be corrected in the very near future."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 402213, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400154, "text": "Your Honor, I..."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 405115, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403124, "text": "...love you."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 413557, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412533, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 417762, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415703, "text": "Your Honor, I need your help."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 421466, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417939, "text": "- Things get a little backed up in there?\n- Heck, no, we had dinner break."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 424401, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422410, "text": "- Already?\n- Harry, this guy is amazing."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 427412, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424579, "text": "We practically finished\nthe whole docket."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 429413, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427582, "text": "But you said you needed my help?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 431347, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429584, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 434310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431819, "text": "Would you get this knot out for me?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 437551, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435356, "text": "Sure, that's what I'm here for."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 441156, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 438926, "text": "- Yeah?\n- A two-hour dinner break."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 443593, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441329, "text": "- Can you believe it?\n- I got time to get some jogging in."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 445824, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 443765, "text": "- Pshew. Hi, Harry.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 450095, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446534, "text": "So Mac says things are going okay?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 451295, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450271, "text": "Smooth as silk."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 454930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 451472, "text": "It's amazing how fast things go\nwhen there isn't so much goofing off."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 460913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456544, "text": "I mean, of course,\ngoofing off in a professional sense."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 465342, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462316, "text": "- There you go.\n- Well, thank you, sir."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 466544, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465520, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 468712, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 466721, "text": "If you need anything else, I'll be here."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 471324, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468890, "text": "Stapling things to my face."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 474359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 471492, "text": "Well, you have fun, sir."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 477254, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476230, "text": "Your Honor?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 480166, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478266, "text": "Oh. You're busy. I'll be back later."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 484327, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480334, "text": "No, come on in, Selma.\nWe were just discussing Judge Koppelson."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 487235, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 484505, "text": "Aw. What a sweetheart, huh?"}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 491233, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487775, "text": "Sounds like you're headed for a gang hug."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 493714, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491746, "text": "Go on, tell them."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 495639, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494081, "text": "Tell us what?"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 498479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 495817, "text": "Oh, listen,\nit's starting to sound like a big deal."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 499915, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498653, "text": "It's no big deal."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 501281, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500087, "text": "What isn't?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 504050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501456, "text": "I'm going to Florida\nand shack up with Marty."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 506958, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505593, "text": "You're getting married?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 510692, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 507495, "text": "She doesn't know\nwhat shacking up means?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 514597, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511799, "text": "- Sir, we got a problem.\n- Mac, Selma's going to Florida."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 516361, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514769, "text": "Be sure to hit Disney World."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 518903, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516537, "text": "- Sir, I'm afraid this is urgent.\n- What is it?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 522406, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519073, "text": "I just called a Brooklyn court\nto transfer a few grand jury felonies."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 524477, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522577, "text": "Judge Koppelson needed more to do."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 526044, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524645, "text": "From the sound of things..."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 529843, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 526214, "text": "...he should be able to clean up\nthe national crime problem by dawn."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 532110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530017, "text": "Harry...\n- He's not using my gavel, is he?"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 536416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532286, "text": "Harry, there is no Judge Koppelson\nin the Brooklyn court."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 539492, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 536591, "text": "There's no Judge Koppelson anywhere."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 541127, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 539660, "text": "He's a fraud."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 544024, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 542363, "text": "Oh, no, I don't believe that."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 545597, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544198, "text": "That's incredible."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 552731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550638, "text": "I could have told you so."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 559336, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557345, "text": "Yeah. Uh-huh."}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 563409, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560781, "text": "Okay, well, thank you."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 564608, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563584, "text": "Any sign of him?"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 567219, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564785, "text": "- Dan took him out to dinner.\n- Really?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 570653, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567388, "text": "Bull went to the local suck-up eateries\nto see if he could find him."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 571883, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570825, "text": "Good thinking."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 576094, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 572693, "text": "Well, it turns out our Mr. Koppelson\nis with the Brooklyn court system."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 577458, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 576264, "text": "Then he is a judge."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 578929, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 577632, "text": "Then he is a clerk."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 580260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579100, "text": "- A clerk?\nMm-hm."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 582666, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580835, "text": "In the Records Division, for 35 years."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 585499, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582837, "text": "And he's got a good record,\nbut he's got no law degree..."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 587038, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585673, "text": "...and no college education."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 588505, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587208, "text": "That's incredible."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 592976, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588676, "text": "I mean, this guy just walks in off the street\nwearing a robe..."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 596776, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593147, "text": "...plops himself on the bench,\nand everybody falls for it?"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 599977, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596951, "text": "- He must think you people are a bunch of...\n- Boneheads."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 603917, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 601289, "text": "Well, I can see that you're busy."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 607117, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 604091, "text": "I'll see you in the cafeteria, bunny rabbit."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 610724, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608062, "text": "I'll count the seconds, tiger."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 623840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621042, "text": "Love can be sickening, can't it?"}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 628046, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625646, "text": "Mac, go get me the cases\nthat Koppelson ruled on."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 630513, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628215, "text": "- All of them?\n- Well, how many are there?"}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 631811, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630685, "text": "Eighty-four."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 633544, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631986, "text": "In less than three hours?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 635621, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633721, "text": "I'm telling you, Harry, the guy is..."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 638782, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635790, "text": "Amazing, incredible, the best.\nYeah, I remember."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 641451, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 638960, "text": "All right, I'm going.\nI'll help Mac with the cases."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 645360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641629, "text": "Right. Use a forklift if you have to."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 652334, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650104, "text": "Well, where's my lecture?"}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 655600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 652506, "text": "- Lecture?\n- About running off to Miami..."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 660804, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655776, "text": "...with a man I haven't seen\nsince the Louisiana Purchase."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 662882, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661449, "text": "Selma..."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 665575, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663050, "text": "...now, you know we all care about you."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 668654, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 665753, "text": "You can't walk in here\nand tell us you're moving to Florida..."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 670984, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668823, "text": "...and not expect us to be concerned."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 673016, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671492, "text": "Well, be quick about it, Harry..."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 676652, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673194, "text": "...because I've got decades\nto make up for tonight."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 678756, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 677732, "text": "Selma..."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 680430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 679133, "text": "Save it, Harry."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 684264, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 680601, "text": "I'm cresting on a wave of love."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 685700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 684438, "text": "That bad, huh?"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 688239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685873, "text": "He makes my elbows sweat."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 690672, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 688909, "text": "I get the picture."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 693271, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692213, "text": "Selma..."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 697741, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696717, "text": "...be careful."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 701348, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698686, "text": "Would I disappoint you?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 710862, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707028, "text": "Hey, it could have happened to anybody."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 714598, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712266, "text": "Judge Stone,\nyour bailiff said there was a problem."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 717465, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714769, "text": "I'm afraid there is, Arnold.\nWhere did you find him, Bull?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 721540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717638, "text": "Dan's favorite restaurant, La Pretense."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 724541, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 723244, "text": "What the hell is going on?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 728239, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 724712, "text": "Bigfoot comes barging into the restaurant,\npractically drags us out."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 730077, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 728416, "text": "Why don't you tell him, Arnold?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 735281, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731652, "text": "I talked to your supervisor.\nI know who you are."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 739757, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737425, "text": "Who are he?"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 741087, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739927, "text": "Arnold?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 747326, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744198, "text": "I'm a clerk in the Record Division\nover at Brooklyn court."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 751334, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749036, "text": "A clerk?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 752930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751906, "text": "I'm afraid so."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 755302, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 753107, "text": "I promised you could be godfather\nto my first..."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 758036, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755476, "text": "...and you're telling me you're a clerk?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 763047, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 758212, "text": "I suppose this puts our ski weekend\nin Vermont on the back burner, doesn't it?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 770986, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769223, "text": "Lobsters and wine."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 773092, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771158, "text": "What else?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 780497, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778666, "text": "This is moving."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 781760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 780668, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 783460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781936, "text": "I meant the lobster."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 790039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 785773, "text": "Julia taught me how to pack them live\nright from the dock."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 792076, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 790211, "text": "The cook is boiling the water."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 794578, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 792747, "text": "- Julia?\n- That's my wife's name."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 798149, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795282, "text": "I brought them up from Florida with me\non the plane."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 799843, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 798319, "text": "They got a window seat. Ha-ha-ha."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 801844, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800354, "text": "A window seat. Ha-ha-ha."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 805517, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 802923, "text": "You were always a tough audience."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 808290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806026, "text": "So, what's the plan?"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 813999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 809096, "text": "We pack your things,\nwe fly to Fort Lauderdale, we go crazy."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 817695, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814168, "text": "I like it.\nIs your place near the courthouse?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 820033, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 817872, "text": "Maybe there is some job openings."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 821674, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 820207, "text": "Ha-ha. Job openings?"}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 825608, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821842, "text": "Why on earth would you want a job?\nI've got plenty of money."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 828146, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825780, "text": "It's not the money. I like to work."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 830047, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828716, "text": "Julia never did."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 833545, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830417, "text": "- Marty...\n- Excuse me, is this the Ratner party?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 834745, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 833721, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 837015, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834922, "text": "I was told to play for two people in love."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 838180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 837191, "text": "Enjoy."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 845731, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 842830, "text": "Wait, wait, wait a minute,\nthere must be some mistake."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 848334, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845900, "text": "I ordered a violin player."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 851335, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848502, "text": "He had to cancel, so they sent me."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 853336, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851505, "text": "Please don't ask me to leave."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 856340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 853507, "text": "Everybody asks me to leave."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 859807, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 856610, "text": "If you ask me to leave,\nI'm going to take the elevator to the roof..."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 862278, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859980, "text": "...and plunge to my death."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 866379, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862716, "text": "Just make sure you take that with you."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 870617, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867454, "text": "- Mister?\n- Well, I suppose it'll be okay."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 873259, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871325, "text": "I owe you my life."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 876522, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873894, "text": "Just keep it soft and romantic."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 878121, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877097, "text": "Got it."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 884994, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882503, "text": "Lovely. I mean that."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 888540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 886640, "text": "Listen, Marty."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 890973, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888709, "text": "Hold it a minute, chucko."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 893011, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891612, "text": "I'll tell you when."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 896649, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894215, "text": "Selma,\nI know you've enjoyed your job up here."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 899752, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896817, "text": "But why should you work\nwhen I can take care of you?"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 901148, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899920, "text": "Julia never worked."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 904849, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901322, "text": "What did she do all day, pack seafood?"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 908424, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906126, "text": "She used to knit me things."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 910757, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908596, "text": "She made me soufflés."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 912455, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910931, "text": "Cleaned the house."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 915966, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912633, "text": "She had aprons from all 50 states."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 918400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916136, "text": "Marty, listen to me."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 923839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918572, "text": "I don't knit, I don't cook,\nI don't clean houses."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 927037, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924011, "text": "- That's why God gave us other people.\n- Ha-ha."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 930178, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927448, "text": "Selma, you're a scream."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 934913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930351, "text": "Now, seriously, I know that you'll enjoy\nnot having the grind of a daily job."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 937319, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 935089, "text": "Please, let me take care of you."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 940756, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937491, "text": "Oh, and in return, I take care of you?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 943255, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941128, "text": "Isn't that what love is all about?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 949696, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946533, "text": "Not yet. Not yet."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 953304, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950471, "text": "Sorry. The moment moved me."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 957705, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 955009, "text": "- Marty.\n- Yes, lamb chop?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 961405, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957878, "text": "Marty, maybe we'd better hold off\non that jet."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 963646, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961815, "text": "What are you talking about?"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 966377, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963817, "text": "Sounds like dump city, pal."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 970950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966854, "text": "Leave or scarlet bellows\nwill start to spread."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 975387, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 972259, "text": "My father made me take lessons."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 977655, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 975562, "text": "God will punish him."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 987471, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982636, "text": "You had us, accomplished attorneys,\npracticing law in front of you..."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 991270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987641, "text": "...a clerk charading as a magistrate,\nfor almost three hours."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 995181, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992246, "text": "You have made a mockery\nout of this country's justice system."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 997317, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995349, "text": "And you have nothing to say\nfor yourself?"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1001084, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 998752, "text": "I enjoyed the rack of lamb."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1004190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1001255, "text": "I want it back. It's mine."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1007691, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004358, "text": "Now, what is this nonsense\nabout not going away with me?"}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1010295, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007861, "text": "Listen to yourself, Marty.\nYou don't want me."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1012261, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010464, "text": "You want a domestic."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1016233, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012433, "text": "What you and Julia had all these years\nwas great."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1018394, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1016403, "text": "But it's not my kind of great."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1022173, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1019306, "text": "Selma, I never thought of you as a maid."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1023901, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022343, "text": "I thought of you as a woman."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1025511, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1024078, "text": "I know, doll."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1030116, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025679, "text": "But I just don't think\nI'm quite what you have in mind."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1032479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030284, "text": "You're used to something else."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1038222, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036357, "text": "I guess I am."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1040383, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1038392, "text": "I always was a little helpless."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1044628, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040828, "text": "You made the right choice\nin 1938, Marty."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1048234, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1044798, "text": "I'm sure I could bring myself\nto change a little."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1049835, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048402, "text": "Maybe we both can."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1052632, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050004, "text": "- Marty...\n- Did I mention the double gas oven?"}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1056873, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1053073, "text": "I use mine to dry my pantyhose."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1059869, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058345, "text": "I see what you mean."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1067144, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062616, "text": "Listen, I know how you all must be feeling,\nand I can't blame you for being angry."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1069619, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067321, "text": "But I fully expected to go to jail."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1071382, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069790, "text": "You knew this was gonna happen?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1074288, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071558, "text": "Sure. I'm just surprised\nthat I lasted as long as I did."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1077919, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1074461, "text": "- Well, why did you do it?\n- I always wanted to."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1081556, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078098, "text": "Well, that's certainly stupid."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1083667, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082302, "text": "No, not really."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1087000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1083837, "text": "You see, I'm retiring next month."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1093142, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087374, "text": "I used to sit at my little desk for 30 years\nwhile the judges came and went..."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1096441, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093313, "text": "...night after night,\nwatching and waiting..."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1099051, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1096617, "text": "...and dreaming that one day,\nI'd be up there myself."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1102416, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1099219, "text": "And then this afternoon\nwhen the call came for a replacement..."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1106616, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102589, "text": "...it occurred to me that maybe\nthis would be my last chance."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1108824, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107061, "text": "Do you know something?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1112397, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108996, "text": "Even now I get the feeling you're not\nthe slightest bit sorry about this."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1114534, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112566, "text": "- Well, I'm not.\n- Incredible."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1117162, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1115069, "text": "Why? I did a hell of a job."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1118933, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117671, "text": "He's right."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1120831, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119807, "text": "He is?"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1124466, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121008, "text": "As far as I'm concerned, yup."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1129347, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124978, "text": "I would've made the same decision\nin virtually every one of these cases."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1133714, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129516, "text": "Well, the prosecution did an excellent job.\nIt made my work easy."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1135184, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133887, "text": "- Thank you.\n- You're welcome."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1138222, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135355, "text": "- Geek.\n- Bootlicker."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1142359, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138992, "text": "Mac, I'll sign these myself later\nand then you can take them downstairs."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1144121, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142529, "text": "I'll finish off the night."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1145424, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144298, "text": "What about this guy?"}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1148700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145833, "text": "Oh, don't worry about me.\nI'm familiar with the prison system."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1150632, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148869, "text": "I'll get along."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1151896, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150804, "text": "Go home, Arnold."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1156709, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155242, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1158576, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157177, "text": "Go home."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1162181, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158745, "text": "Putting you in jail is only gonna cost\nthe city money for no reason."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1164241, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1162683, "text": "But I committed a crime."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1165851, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1164418, "text": "First offense, right?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1167684, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1166353, "text": "Well, yes, that's true, but..."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1171256, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1167855, "text": "\"He made a mistake,\nand based on my 30 years of experience..."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1174826, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1171425, "text": "...l'm gonna take a chance\nthat he learned something from it.\""}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1177128, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175729, "text": "I said that, didn't I?"}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1179629, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177297, "text": "Steven's case. It was a first offense too."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1183395, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1180267, "text": "Well, based on\nmy two years of experience..."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1186801, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1183570, "text": "...l'm gonna take\nthe same chance on you, Arnold."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1188601, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186974, "text": "Now, go home."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1194905, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192846, "text": "Thank you, Your Honor."}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1200476, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196483, "text": "Oh, just so you know,\nyou really are big in Brooklyn."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1202612, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201588, "text": "Arnold."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1206223, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204358, "text": "You would've made a good judge."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1209891, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207161, "text": "I was a good judge."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1229415, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227447, "text": "- Hi.\n- Hi."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1233046, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230350, "text": "I thought\nyou might have thought things over."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1235519, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233654, "text": "- I did.\n- And?"}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1238681, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236190, "text": "Can you picture this body in an apron?"}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1243590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1239426, "text": "No. But I can picture it without an apron."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1246123, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244531, "text": "December 12th."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1249326, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246300, "text": "The observation deck\nof the Empire State Building."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1251232, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249503, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1257101, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1253574, "text": "I think we were facing north."}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1259541, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257277, "text": "Listen, I want you to take this."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1261806, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1259713, "text": "It rowed up with the lobsters."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1264450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261982, "text": "\"1938.\""}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1266913, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265252, "text": "It was a very good year."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1270279, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268755, "text": "See you, Selma."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1272318, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270657, "text": "See you, Marty."}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1283130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279433, "text": "We held the record\nuntil the World Trade Center went up."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1294777, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291979, "text": "- Hi, Selma.\n- Hi, Harry."}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1296640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295616, "text": "What happened?"}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1301746, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297184, "text": "We had some wine,\nkilled some crustaceans..."}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1305119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301922, "text": "...and then some guy\nplayed military music."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1312561, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308295, "text": "- What about Marty?\n- It turns out he wanted somebody else."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1316725, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314234, "text": "- I'm sorry.\n- No sweat."}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1318598, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316903, "text": "If you're interested..."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1323436, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318772, "text": "...and if you're wondering if a heart\ncan beat through nine presidents..."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1327841, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324144, "text": "...six husbands, 45 springs..."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1333980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328348, "text": "...and still race at the sight of a tan Buick\ndriving up the street..."}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1336782, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334154, "text": "...honey, I'm here to tell you it can."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1345058, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343397, "text": "I'll bet it can."}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1347257, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345232, "text": "Oh, I've been through worse."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1350631, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1347434, "text": "Well, tonight, you'll be through better."}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1352931, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350804, "text": "Lets you and me go out after the session."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1354300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353106, "text": "Oh, don't worry about it."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1355873, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354474, "text": "Come on, it'll cheer you up."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1358068, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1356043, "text": "Oh, seriously, I'm fine."}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1360543, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358245, "text": "Selma, you're not fine."}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1363308, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1360714, "text": "Hi, Selma.\n- Oh, hi, Brent."}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1366646, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1363483, "text": "- Pick you up at 11?\n- Sure."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1370148, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1367554, "text": "I'm looking forward to it."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1377762, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375862, "text": "Your nephew."}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1380131, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378231, "text": "Your lawyer?"}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1382632, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1380300, "text": "Your nephew's lawyer?"}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1385203, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382803, "text": "Your lawyer's nephew?"}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1388440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1386540, "text": "Carpool?"}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1391508, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1389176, "text": "Insurance salesman?"}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1394946, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1392512, "text": "Bailiff trainee."}
